Third-party content redistributed in this repository:

- data/processed/passages.json contains text from the FastAPI documentation
  (https://github.com/fastapi/fastapi), Copyright (c) 2018 Sebastián Ramírez,
  MIT License. It is pinned to upstream commit 7d210a4a and is included so the
  service can start and so the saved benchmark numbers refer to a fixed corpus.

- models/docs-reranker-minilm/ is cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2
  (Apache 2.0) fine-tuned on this project's gold questions.

Models downloaded at run time keep their own licenses: BAAI/bge-m3 (MIT) and
Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct (Qwen Research License).
